iddle value of the county&rsquo;s 4 grids. August to September came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those years, more than any other pair, and in 2025 it ran 31% of normal. Every grid had its driest year in 1976, with grid 23267 at 64%. In 2026 so far, May to June came in at 165% of normal on the middle of the grids.</p>"}
